.TH AVR\-SKILL\-UNINSTALL 1 "" "avr" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-skill-uninstall \- Remove the installed avr skill.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr skill uninstall
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Remove the installed avr skill.
.PP
Without --agent, the skill is removed from both locations. With --project, it is removed from the current git repository. Other files in the skill directory are kept.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-agent\fR \fICHOICE\fR
Location to uninstall from (repeatable): claude or agents. Defaults to both. (choices: claude, agents, codex; repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-\-project\fR
Use the current git repository instead of your home directory.
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Remove a skill that avr did not install.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-skill (1),
.BR avr-skill-install (1),
.BR avr-skill-show (1)
